        "eyebrow": "Safety profile",
        "heading": "Is it gentle enough for my child?",
        "intro": "<p>Anything with “herbal” and “gut” on the label can sound intimidating for a little one. Most of that reputation comes from strong adult tinctures that were never made for children.</p><p><strong>ParaPatrol was made for kids from day one</strong>, so every choice in the formula starts with one question: is this right for a 3-year-old?</p>",
        "ing_heading": "Ingredient by ingredient",
        "ing_intro": "If you Google some of these herbs, you’ll find warnings. Here’s what each one is doing in ParaPatrol, and the honest context behind the headlines.",
        "who_heading": "Who it’s for",
        "stop_heading": "Stop and call your doctor if",
        "callout": "Itchy bottom at night or worms you can see? That’s a job for your doctor, not a supplement.",
